# Where the running system finds the U-Boot environment, which holds the
# boot-selection state RAUC reads and writes. These two offsets and the size must
# match CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET, CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET_REDUND and CONFIG_ENV_SIZE in
# board/ota/beaglebone_black/uboot.config exactly; a mismatch is silent and makes
# every update roll back. The region lies in the gap before the first partition and
# belongs to no filesystem.
#
# Device         Primary offset   Size
/dev/mmcblk0     0x80000          0x20000
/dev/mmcblk0     0xa0000          0x20000
